[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0612","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0612.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57874","title":"Linux Kernel arm64 ptrace 未初始化变量导致内核栈信息泄露漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 arm64 架构的 ptrace 子系统中，`tagged_addr_ctrl_set()` 函数在处理 `NT_ARM_TAGGED_ADDR_CTRL` 寄存器集时未初始化临时变量 `ctrl`，当通过 `SETREGSET` 以零长度调用时，函数会使用栈上未初始化的值，导致最多 64 位内核栈内存信息泄露。该漏洞为本地漏洞，攻击者需具备低权限访问，通过构造特制的 ptrace 调用即可触发。由于 `set_tagged_addr_ctrl()` 仅接受 bits[63:4] 为零的值，泄露利用受限且写入机制不可用，但可能造成系统不稳定或敏感信息泄露。CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57874"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T15:15:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:07Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.13 及以上版本，或更新至以下已包含补丁的稳定版：5.10.231、5.15.174、6.1.120、6.6.66、6.12.5。各发行版用户请安装对应安全更新（如 Debian 用户参考 DLA-4075，Ubuntu 用户参考 USN-7381-1/USN-7450-1）。如无法立即升级，可通过禁用 ptrace 系统调用或限制非特权用户对 SETREGSET 的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1152dd13845efde5554f80c7e1233bae1d26bd3e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1370cf3eb5495d70e00547598583a4cd45b40b99","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1c176f5155ee6161fee6f416b64aa50394d3f220","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/96035c0093db258975b8887676afe59a64c34a72","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/abd614bbfcee73247495bd9472da8f85ac83546e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ca62d90085f4af36de745883faab9f8a7cbb45d3","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57874.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57874.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57874","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57874.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57874.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57874.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57874-2025-11-03-1451","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57874.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-xvfj-8qrf-7mc3/GHSA-xvfj-8qrf-7mc3.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57874"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0612.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0611","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0611.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57872","title":"Linux Kernel SCSI UFS 平台驱动内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 UFS（通用闪存存储）驱动中的 ufshcd_pltfrm_remove() 函数在移除平台设备时未正确释放 HBA（主机总线适配器）结构体，导致 scsi_host_dev_release() 无法被正常调用，从而引发内存泄漏。本地攻击者可通过反复加载卸载 UFS 驱动模块触发该漏洞，长期运行后可能导致系统内存资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各发行版本，需本地低权限访问，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57872"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T15:15:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:07Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 6.12.5 或更高版本（包含提交 cd188519d246 和 897df60c16d5 的修复）。对于无法立即升级的系统，可应用补丁文件 drivers/ufs/host/ufshcd-pltfrm.c 中 ufshcd_pltfrm_remove() 函数的修复，确保在移除时调用 scsi_host_dev_release() 正确释放 HBA 内存。使用长期支持发行版（如 Ubuntu 24.04 LTS）的用户应安装 USN-7381-1 或 USN-7450-1 安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/897df60c16d54ad515a3d0887edab5c63da06d1f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cd188519d2467ab4c2141587b0551ba030abff0e","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57872.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57872.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57872","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2024-57872.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57872.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-57872-scsi-ufs-pltfrm-dellocate-hba-durin-1767883840000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-6jqj-g976-vcvw/GHSA-6jqj-g976-vcvw.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57872","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/49fc6c5c0668d68233834d9d61b1c916248edd25/osv/AZL-55773.json","https://github.com/InfoSecREDD/CVE-Discord-Notify/blob/3f4b2b159624fda9a5cd9efcc2a46893068cd4db/seen_cves.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0611.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0608","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0608.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57850","title":"Linux kernel jffs2 rtime解压缩内存损坏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 JFFS2 文件系统的 rtime 解压缩例程在解压过程中未充分校验边界条件，当处理特制的损坏压缩数据时，会导致越界写入解压缩缓冲区之外的内存区域，造成内存损坏。本地攻击者可通过挂载恶意的 JFFS2 文件系统镜像触发此漏洞，可能导致系统崩溃或权限提升。该漏洞影响所有使用 JFFS2 文件系统的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57850"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T15:15:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:06Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至以下安全版本：5.4.287、5.10.231、5.15.174、6.1.120、6.6.66、6.12.5 或更高版本。对于 Debian 系统，安装 DLA-4075-1 安全更新；对于 Ubuntu 24.04 LTS，安装 USN-7381-1 更新。如无法立即升级内核，可通过禁用 JFFS2 文件系统模块（`echo \"blacklist jffs2\" > /etc/modprobe.d/disable-jffs2.conf && update-initramfs -u`）并卸载已挂载的 JFFS2 分区作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/421f9e9f0fae9f8e721ffa07f22d9765fa1214d5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/47c9a7f81027a78afea9d2e9a54bfd8fabb6b3d0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6808a1812a3419542223e7fe9e2de577e99e45d1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bd384b04ad1995441b18fe6c1366d02de8c5d5eb","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dc39b08fcc3831b0bc46add91ba93cd2aab50716","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f6fc251baefc3cdc4f41f2f5a47940d7d4a67332","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fe051552f5078fa02d593847529a3884305a6ffe","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57850.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57850.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57850.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57850","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57850.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57850.md","https://github.com/openharmony/security/blob/f47b282130050082f1bcf6813aaced4157bd1771/vulntest/SSTSTestcases/2025/09/CVE-2024-57850/TestCaseRule-CVE-2024-57850.yara","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57850.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57850-2025-11-03-1451","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57850-jffs2-prevent-rtime-decompress-memo-1771405381000.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0608.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0607","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0607.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57843","title":"Linux kernel virtio-net 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 virtio-net 驱动中的 virtnet_rq_alloc 函数存在整数溢出漏洞。当系统配置 net.core.high_order_alloc_disable 为 1 时，frag 分配始终仅获取一页内存，而 virtnet_rq_dma 结构体占用 16 字节位于 frag 头部，导致缓冲区与结构体总大小超过单页边界触发溢出。具有本地低权限的攻击者可利用此漏洞造成虚拟机崩溃或 SCP 大文件传输失败，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用 virtio-net 的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57843"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T15:15:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:06Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.6.66、6.12.5 或 6.13 及以上版本（对应修复 commit a8f7d6963768/67a11de8965c/6aacd1484468）。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户更新至 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可临时设置 sysctl net.core.high_order_alloc_disable=0 降低触发概率，但建议尽快重启加载新内核完成修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/67a11de8965c2ab19e215fb6651d44847e068614","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6aacd1484468361d1d04badfe75f264fa5314864","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a8f7d6963768b114ec9644ff0148dde4c104e84b","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57843.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57843.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57843","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2024-57843.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57843.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57843.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57843.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-rvwg-gc58-2352/GHSA-rvwg-gc58-2352.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57843","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/49fc6c5c0668d68233834d9d61b1c916248edd25/osv/AZL-67779.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0607.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0604","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0604.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57809","title":"Linux 内核 NXP i.MX6QDL PCI 挂起恢复功能拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 i.MX6QDL 平台的 PCI imx6 驱动程序中存在挂起/恢复功能缺陷，在挂起后恢复时未能正确重置连接的 PCIe 设备，导致设备无法从 D3hot 状态切换回 D0 状态，触发内核崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可通过连接特定 PCIe 设备（如 ath10k 或 iwlwifi 无线网卡）并触发挂起/恢复操作，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 i.MX6QDL 处理器的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57809"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T14:15:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:04Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.12.4 或 6.13 及以上版本，对应提交为 ac43ea3d27a8 和 0a726f542d7c。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户可通过 `sudo apt update && sudo apt install linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency` 安装 USN-7381-1 更新后重启。若无法立即升级，避免在 i.MX6QDL 设备上执行 suspend/resume 操作，或临时禁用 PCIe 设备作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0a726f542d7c8cc0f9c5ed7df5a4bd4b59ac21b3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ac43ea3d27a8f9beadf3af66c9ea4a566ebfff1f","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57809.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57809.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57809","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2024-57809.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57809.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57809.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-57809-pci-imx6-fix-suspendresume-support--1767883598000.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57809.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-m7r3-8cxw-w4p4/GHSA-m7r3-8cxw-w4p4.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57809"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0604.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0603","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0603.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57807","title":"Linux 内核 MegaRAID SAS 死锁漏洞","description":"Linux内核megaraid_sas驱动存在潜在死锁漏洞，源于reset_mutex与scan_mutex两个互斥锁存在循环锁依赖：CPU0持有reset_mutex等待scan_mutex，而CPU1持有scan_mutex等待reset_mutex，形成死锁导致系统挂起。该漏洞影响使用MegaRAID SAS控制器的Linux内核系统，CVSS 5.5（中危），攻击向量为本地，攻击复杂度低，需低权限，无需用户交互，可用性影响高。本地攻击者可通过触发并发SCSI操作（如设备重置与扫描同时进行）诱发相反顺序获取双锁，导致内核死锁拒绝服务。Linux内核已通过在获取scan_mutex前临时释放reset_mutex修复此死锁问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57807"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:04Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至包含修复的版本：Linux 6.12.5、6.11.11、6.6.63、6.1.120、5.15.179、5.10.234、5.4.291 或更高版本。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7381-1 提供的内核更新（linux-image-6.8.0-52-generic 等），Ubuntu 20.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7459-1 更新，Debian 11 用户请应用 DLA-4075-1 更新。如无法立即升级内核，可暂时卸载 megaraid_sas 模块（modprobe -r megaraid_sas）或在启动参数中禁用该驱动（modprobe.blacklist=megaraid_sas）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3c654998a3e8167a58b6c6fede545fe400a4b554","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/466ca39dbf5d0ba71c16b15c27478a9c7d4022a8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/50740f4dc78b41dec7c8e39772619d5ba841ddd7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/78afb9bfad00c4aa58a424111d7edbcab9452f2b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/edadc693bfcc0f1ea08b8fa041c9361fd042410d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f36d024bd15ed356a80dda3ddc46d0a62aa55815","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f50783148ec98a1d38b87422e2ceaf2380b7b606","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57807.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57807.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57807.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57807","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57807.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57807.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57807.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57807-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-cr25-mcg8-cfvp/GHSA-cr25-mcg8-cfvp.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57807"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0603.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0602","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0602.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57804","title":"Linux内核 SCSI mpi3mr驱动 配置页面损坏漏洞","description":"Linux内核SCSI驱动程序mpi3mr存在一个配置页面破坏漏洞。驱动程序通过SAS传输暴露的sysfs接口，允许启用/禁用控制器/扩展器中的PHY。当多个PHY被快速启用/禁用时，会导致与SAS IO单元/SAS扩展器相关的持久和当前配置页面遭到破坏。攻击者通过sysfs接口需要本地访问权限，触发PHY状态的快速切换操作，从而引发配置页面损坏。该漏洞影响Linux内核版本，CVSS评分5.5（中等严重性）。尽管目前没有报告出具体的利用实例或直接影响，但配置页面的破坏可能导致系统不稳定，并可能为进一步攻击提供机会。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57804"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:04Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至已修复版本：Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 请安装 USN-7381-1 提供的内核更新（linux-image-6.8.0-52-generic 及以上）；Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 请安装 USN-7514-1 提供的内核更新。其他发行版请升级至 Linux 6.12.2、6.11.11、6.6.66、6.1.117 或 5.15.176 及以上版本。若暂无法升级内核，可通过 `echo 0 > /sys/class/scsi_host/hostX/device/phy_enable` 禁用受影响控制器的 PHY 切换功能作为临时缓解，但会失去 PHY 启用/禁用功能。建议优先通过发行版包管理器（如 `apt update && apt upgrade linux-image-generic`）应用官方内核更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/711201a8b8334a397440ac0b859df0054e174bc9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/869fdc6f0606060301aef648231e186c7c542f5a","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57804.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57804.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57804.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57804","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57804.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57804.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57804.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57804.html","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-57804-scsi-mpi3mr-fix-corrupt-config-page-1767883799000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-q94p-cf39-j6hv/GHSA-q94p-cf39-j6hv.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0602.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0599","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0599.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57798","title":"Linux Linux Kernel DRM DP MST 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DRM DP MST 子系统的 `drm_dp_mst_handle_up_req()` 函数中存在空指针解引用与释放后使用漏洞。当一个线程处理 MST 上行请求消息时，另一线程可能通过 `drm_dp_mst_topology_mgr_set_mst(false)` 移除 MST 拓扑结构，释放 `mst_primary` 指针并置为 NULL，导致并发访问时出现空指针解引用或释放后使用，可能造成本地权限提升或系统崩溃。攻击者需具备本地低权限即可利用，影响使用 Linux 内核的各类系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57798"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:03Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至至少 6.1.82 版本或以上；如果使用 Ubuntu 22.04 LTS，请执行 `sudo apt update && sudo apt install linux-generic-hwe-22.04` 进行内核升级；Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 执行 `sudo apt update && sudo apt install linux-generic-hwe-24.04`。如无法立即升级，可通过在内核启动参数中添加 `drm_dp_mst_topology_mgr_set_mst=0` 禁用 MST 功能作为临时缓解措施（需重新启动生效），但会导致多显示器 MST 链路不可用，适用于低风险环境。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9735d40f5fde9970aa46e828ecc85c32571d58a2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ce55818b2d3a999f886af91679589e4644ff1dc8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e54b00086f7473dbda1a7d6fc47720ced157c6a8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f61b2e5e7821f868d6afc22382a66a30ee780ba0","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57798.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57798.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57798.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57798","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57798.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57798.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57798-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57798.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57798-drmdp-mst-ensure-mst-primary-pointe-1771412343000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-9x94-vh8x-vrhp/GHSA-9x94-vh8x-vrhp.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0599.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0564","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0564.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56369","title":"Linux kernel DRM modesetting 除零错误漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DRM 子系统的 drm_mode_vrefresh() 函数在计算显示器刷新率时存在除零漏洞。该函数虽已检查 htotal 和 vtotal 是否为 0，但未充分处理 vtotal 与 htotal 乘积后仍可能出现的除零异常，导致内核崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可通过设置特定的显示模式参数触发此漏洞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响 Linux 内核版本的系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56369"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:28Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:07Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：5.15.176、6.1.122、6.6.68、6.12.7 或 6.13 及以上。各发行版用户可通过包管理器更新：Ubuntu 运行 `apt update && apt upgrade linux-image` 并重启；Debian 参考 DLA-4041-1 公告更新内核。如无法立即升级，可通过 seccomp 或 AppArmor 限制本地用户加载自定义显示模式作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/47c8b6cf1d08f0ad40d7ea7b025442e51b35ee1f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/69fbb01e891701e6d04db1ddb5ad49e42c4dd963","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9398332f23fab10c5ec57c168b44e72997d6318e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b39de5a71bac5641d0fda33d1cf5682d82cf1ae5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e7c7b48a0fc5ed83baae400a1b15e33978c25d7f","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56369.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56369.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56369.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56369","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56369.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56369-2025-11-03-1435","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-56369.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56369.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56369","https://github.com/openharmony/docs/blob/f41b9345badd47c7ab0c263344cd7f4b5a549afb/en/release-notes/OpenHarmony-v4.1.3-release.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0564.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0562","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0562.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-55916","title":"Linux Kernel Hyper-V 工具驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Hyper-V 驱动工具（hv_util）中的 KVP（键值对）和 VSS（卷影副本）组件存在条件竞争漏洞。当 KVP 或 VSS 守护进程在 VMBus 通道的环形缓冲区完全初始化之前启动时，守护进程通过字符设备注册自身会触发尚未就绪的回调函数，导致空指针解引用，引发内核崩溃（panic）。本地攻击者可在具备低权限条件下，通过控制 KVP/VSS 守护进程的启动时机触发该条件竞争，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。官方修复方案为调整 util_probe() 中的初始化顺序，确保在 vmbus_open() 完成环形缓冲区初始化后再创建字符设备入口。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-55916"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:28Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:11:26Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：5.4.289、5.10.233、5.15.176、6.1.122、6.6.68、6.12.7 或更高版本。对应各发行版，Debian 11/12 用户安装 linux 6.1.122-1 及以上版本，Ubuntu 24.04 用户安装 USN-7381-1 更新。如无法立即升级，可卸载 hv_utils 内核模块（rmmod hv_utils）并阻止 KVP/VSS 守护进程自启动，避免竞争条件触发内核空指针解引用崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/042253c57be901bfd19f15b68267442b70f510d5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/07a756a49f4b4290b49ea46e089cbe6f79ff8d26","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3dd7a30c6d7f90afcf19e9b072f572ba524d7ec6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/718fe694a334be9d1a89eed22602369ac18d6583","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/89fcec5e466b3ac9b376e0d621c71effa1a7983f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d81f4e73aff9b861671df60e5100ad25cc16fbf8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f091a224a2c82f1e302b1768d73bb6332f687321","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-55916.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/55xxx/CVE-2024-55916.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-55916","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-55916.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/55xxx/CVE-2024-55916.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-55916.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-55916-2025-11-03-1449","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-55916.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4bf73ddbbcc405dd84dc085a0381e11437719536/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-r35m-8jf8-g83g/GHSA-r35m-8jf8-g83g.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-55916"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0562.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0557","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0557.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-54683","title":"Linux Kernel netfilter IDLETIMER ABBA死锁漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 netfilter 子系统的 IDLETIMER 模块存在 ABBA 死锁漏洞。当删除引用某个 idletimer 的最后一条 iptables 规则时，若同时读取 sysfs 中该定时器的状态文件，将导致内核发生循环锁依赖（kn->active 与 list_mutex 互相等待），最终触发系统死锁。本地低权限攻击者可通过并发执行 iptables 规则删除与 sysfs 文件读取操作，造成内核软锁或系统崩溃，影响可用性。该漏洞影响使用 netfilter IDLETIMER 功能的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-54683"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:10:38Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至 6.6.67、6.12.6 或 6.13 及以上版本，该漏洞已在对应稳定分支中修复。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户升级至 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency 及以上版本（USN-7381-1），SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP6/SP7 用户安装 SUSE-SU-2025:1177-1 或 SUSE-SU-2025:01951-1 更新。如无法立即升级，避免在 IDLETIMER 规则与 sysfs 读取操作同时高并发执行，以降低触发死锁概率。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/45fe76573a2557f632e248cc141342233f422b9a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8c2c8445cda8f59c38dec7dc10509bcb23ae26a0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f36b01994d68ffc253c8296e2228dfe6e6431c03","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-54683.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/54xxx/CVE-2024-54683.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-54683.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2024/54xxx/CVE-2024-54683.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-54683","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-54683.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-54683.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/74884340187670a91b9d5bdb799b52e73426ad63/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-4qcv-j3wr-hw24/GHSA-4qcv-j3wr-hw24.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-54683","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-54683.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0557.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0556","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0556.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-54680","title":"Linux Kernel SMB 客户端 TCP 计时器死锁漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 SMB/CIFS 客户端中存在 TCP 计时器死锁漏洞，当卸载 SMB 客户端内核模块（rmmod）时，TCP 计时器未能正确清理，导致内核线程陷入死锁状态，可能引发系统崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 SMB/CIFS 文件系统的 Linux 系统，攻击者可通过诱导系统卸载 SMB 模块触发此问题。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 等发行版已在相关安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-54680"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:27Z","updated":"2025-04-02T16:15:35Z","remediation":"CVE-2024-54680 已被 Linux CNA 于 2025-04-02 正式驳回（REJECTED），该编号对应的 SMB 客户端 TCP 计时器死锁问题被认定为非安全缺陷，无需安装任何安全更新或采取缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/54xxx/CVE-2024-54680.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2025/CVE-2025-22077.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2024/54xxx/CVE-2024-54680.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/mitre/CVE-2024-54680","https://github.com/AwwMann99/VulneRAG/blob/09adf154d3574ffded6af925a6311b0a20df9db0/docs/Cve_Data/cve_md/CVE-2024-54680.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/39aab03fcd8441626e5dea87058d434f682ec433/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-xfp4-237c-chrm/GHSA-xfp4-237c-chrm.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2025/CVE-2025-22077.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2024-54680","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-54680.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/usn/7379-2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0556.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0554","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0554.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-53687","title":"Linux Kernel RISC-V kfence 内存保护中断处理不当导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 RISC-V 架构的 kfence 内存调试子系统中的 kfence_protect_page() 函数在禁用中断的上下文中调用了 flush_tlb_kernel_range()，该函数可能通过核间中断（IPI）向所有 CPU 核心发送 TLB 刷新请求，导致在中断关闭时触发内核警告（smp_call_function_many_cond 中的 WARN_ON），可能引发系统不稳定或拒绝服务。本地攻击者只需低权限即可通过触发特定内存分配释放路径来利用此漏洞。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 RISC-V 架构版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-53687"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:26Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:09:06Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.6.67、6.12.6 或 6.13 及以上版本，对应提交为 b3431a8bb336、6f796a6a396d 和 3abfc4130c42。Ubuntu 用户安装 USN-7381-1 或 USN-7514-1 安全更新。RISC-V 架构下若无法立即升级，可临时禁用 kfence 内核调试功能（内核启动参数添加 kfence.sample_interval=0）作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3abfc4130c4222099c69d023fed97f1180a8ad7b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6f796a6a396d6f963f2cc8f5edd7dfba2cca097f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b3431a8bb336cece8adc452437befa7d4534b2fd","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-53687.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/53xxx/CVE-2024-53687.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-53687","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-53687.yaml","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-53687.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-53687.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-53687.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-53687.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ece131eb82ceb38a160571408bcbbb92bfa0f3c0/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-g9vj-48f4-62vj/GHSA-g9vj-48f4-62vj.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-53687"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0554.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0540","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0540.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-49569","title":"Linux Kernel nvme-rdma 驱动管理队列销毁前未取消静默导致内核挂起漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 nvme-rdma 驱动中存在释放后使用漏洞，在创建 NVMe over RDMA 控制器失败时，驱动对 admin 队列执行了静默（quiesce）操作但未在销毁前取消静默（unquiesce），导致待处理请求无法被排空，内核线程永久阻塞在 blk_mq_freeze_queue_wait() 上，造成系统拒绝服务。攻击者需具备相邻网络访问权限和低权限账户，通过触发控制器创建失败即可利用该漏洞。CVSS 评分 5.7，危害等级中等。Linux 内核主线已提交补丁修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.7,"aliases":["CVE-2024-49569"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:23Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:59:59Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.6.88、6.12.5 或 6.13 及以上版本，或合入修复补丁 05b436f3cf65、427036030f4d、5858b6875598。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7381-1 或 USN-7450-1 安全更新。如无法立即升级，可在不影响业务的前提下限制对 nvme-rdma 设备的本地访问权限作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/05b436f3cf65c957eff86c5ea5ddfa2604b32c63","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/427036030f4d796533dcadba9b845896cb6c10a7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5858b687559809f05393af745cbadf06dee61295","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-49569.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2024/49xxx/CVE-2024-49569.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-49569.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-49569","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2024/CVE-2024-49569.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-49569.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-49569.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-49569.html","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-49569-nvme-rdma-unquiesce-admin-q-before--1771409203000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-q2m4-pgh8-728f/GHSA-q2m4-pgh8-728f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0540.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0539","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0539.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-49568","title":"Linux Kernel SMC 协议提议消息验证不足导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 net/smc（共享内存通信）子系统中存在输入验证缺陷，服务端在处理客户端发送的 proposal 消息时，未对 v2_ext_offset、eid_cnt、ism_gid_cnt 等字段进行充分校验。攻击者可利用该漏洞，通过构造特制的 proposal 消息，使 v2_ext_offset 超出合法范围，导致内核访问错误内存地址，引发系统崩溃。该漏洞需本地低权限访问，CVSS 评分 5.5，仅影响系统可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-49568"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T13:15:23Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:59:59Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至 6.6.68、6.12.7 或 6.13 及以上版本，对应补丁提交为 295a92e3df32、42f6beb2d577、7863c9f3d24b。各发行版用户请安装对应内核更新包：Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 更新至 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency（USN-7381-1），SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP7 安装 SUSE-SU-2025:02307-1 更新。如无法立即升级，可在不需要 SMC 协议的系统上通过 modprobe.blacklist=smc 内核参数禁用 SMC 模块作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/295a92e3df32e72aff0f4bc25c310e349d07ffbf","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/42f6beb2d5779429417b5f8115a4e3fa695d2a6c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7863c9f3d24ba49dbead7e03dfbe40deb5888fdf","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-49568.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2024/49xxx/CVE-2024-49568.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-49568.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-